# The noise floor this study never measured

THE SIGN, so it cannot be misread. Every difference below is

    delta = alpha(the arm named SECOND) - alpha(the arm named FIRST)

and every printed delta names both arms in that order. A positive delta means the
SECOND arm measured a HIGHER re-read fraction.

## The num_stages control, and the comparison it scores

Both are paired over the SAME matched cells. Neither needed a GPU and neither has ever been run before.

CONTROL   2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-alpha-surface-s4
       -> 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3
          varied: num_stages   same machine: True
          alpha            n=11  2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3 measures +0.0103 HIGHER than 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-alpha-surface-s4  sd 0.0328  MDE 0.0308  -> BELOW THE DETECTION LIMIT
          alpha_corrected  n=11  2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3 measures +0.0101 HIGHER than 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-alpha-surface-s4  sd 0.0323  MDE 0.0303  -> BELOW THE DETECTION LIMIT
          alpha_upper      n=11  2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3 measures +0.1553 HIGHER than 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-alpha-surface-s4  sd 0.1744  MDE 0.1634  -> BELOW THE DETECTION LIMIT

UNDER TEST 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3
        -> 2026-09-02-nvidia_a100_sxm4_80gb-alpha-surface-s3
          varied: gpu   same machine: False
          alpha            n=11  2026-09-02-nvidia_a100_sxm4_80gb-alpha-surface-s3 measures +0.0152 HIGHER than 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3  sd 0.0480  MDE 0.0450  -> BELOW THE DETECTION LIMIT
          alpha_corrected  n=11  2026-09-02-nvidia_a100_sxm4_80gb-alpha-surface-s3 measures +0.0117 HIGHER than 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3  sd 0.0480  MDE 0.0450  -> BELOW THE DETECTION LIMIT
          alpha_upper      n=11  2026-09-02-nvidia_a100_sxm4_80gb-alpha-surface-s3 measures -0.3325 LOWER than 2026-09-01-nvidia_h200-cross-card-s3  sd 0.1747  MDE 0.1637  -> RESOLVED

READ IT: a scheduling knob on ONE card, at one L2, moves alpha_corrected by 0.0101. A 1.5x change in L2 capacity moves it by 0.0117. The card exceeds the control by +0.0016, against the control's own detection limit of 0.0303 -- a gap 18x smaller than the smallest gap this design could have seen.
         BOTH differences are themselves under their own detection limits, so the honest statement is not 'the cards agree' but 'this design cannot tell the cards apart, and it cannot tell a card apart from a pipeline stage either'.
POWER:   at sd_d = 0.0480 the 11-cell paired design detects 0.0450. Detecting the observed 0.0117 needs 134 matched cells, which is 12.2x the cells actually run, i.e. 3.5x in standard error.

Detection limits at sd = 0.0229 (the s3/s4 proxy, an UPPER bound), two-sided 5% at 80% power.
The last column is how well N pins the FLOOR itself, pooled over 8 cells.

